#: ../../user/changelog.md:18
msgid ""
"Adopt verifier-cli 1.405 and restore `recommended()` verification IDEs "
"(2025.3 / 2026.1 / 2026.2 EAP)"
msgstr ""
"verifier-cli 1.405 を採用し、`recommended()` の検証対象 IDE "
"(2025.3 / 2026.1 / 2026.2 EAP) を復帰させた"

#: ../../user/changelog.md:20
msgid "0.1.15 (2026-06-13)"
msgstr "0.1.15 (2026-06-13)"

#: ../../user/changelog.md:22 ../../user/changelog.md:46
#: ../../user/changelog.md:89 ../../user/changelog.md:120
