msgstr ""
"Rename Variant Constructor intention — word-index の出現箇所収集による LSP 非依存の "
"Alt+Enter リネーム"

#: ../../user/changelog.md:57
msgid ""
"Hoogle-style Type Signature Search — new \"ReScript Types\" tab in Search"
